### Requests para el cliente HTTP de IntelliJ (guarda cookies entre llamadas automaticamente).
### Orden sugerido: 1 -> 2 -> 3... Cambia "alice" por bob, carol o dave.

### 1. "Inicio de sesion en Entra" (mock): token emitido para el servicio de exchange
POST http://localhost:8090/entra/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=alice&client_secret=lab&scope=token-exchange-service

> {% client.global.set("entra_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 2. JWT exchange: token de Entra -> sesion propia + JWT propio (cookies __Host-sid y __Host-at)
POST http://localhost/token/exchange
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange&subject_token={{entra_token}}&subject_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token&tenant=acme&organization=acme-ventas&return_token=true

> {% client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 3. Que trae el token propio y que tuplas contextuales genera
GET http://localhost/api/whoami

### 4. Documentos visibles para la organizacion activa
GET http://localhost/api/documents

### 5. Editar document:42 (alice es lead del equipo norte -> 200)
PUT http://localhost/api/documents/42
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{$cookie.XSRF-TOKEN}}

{"title": "Plan Norte v2"}

### 6. Leer document:77 de marketing (alice esta en ventas -> 403)
GET http://localhost/api/documents/77

### 7. Cambiar de organizacion (sin volver a Entra)
POST http://localhost/session/context
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{$cookie.XSRF-TOKEN}}

{"tenant": "acme", "organization": "acme-marketing"}

### 8. Renovar el JWT propio (rota la sesion, relee membresias)
POST http://localhost/session/refresh
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{$cookie.XSRF-TOKEN}}

### 9. Datos de la sesion
GET http://localhost/session/me

### 10. Servicio a servicio: token propio -> token para reports-api con "act"
POST http://localhost/token/exchange
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange&subject_token={{access_token}}&audience=reports-api&actor=documents-api

### 11. JWKS del emisor propio
GET http://localhost/token/.well-known/jwks.json

### 12. Rotar la llave de firma (solo laboratorio)
POST http://localhost:8082/token/admin/rotate-keys

### 13. Cerrar sesion
POST http://localhost/session/logout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{$cookie.XSRF-TOKEN}}
